WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.577
Warehouse receiving in Quark WMS. Follow the web
application and RF workflow.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.403
Start with the inbound receipt list in the web
application. Review the receipt records before opening the
document.

3
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.820
Open the receipt and review its lines. This provides the
document context for the receiving operation.

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.926
The demonstration now moves to RF execution, where the
warehouse operator follows the receiving steps.

5
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.099
Open the receiving workflow on the RF terminal.

6
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:07.082
Identify the advance shipping notice, or ASN. This selects
the inbound document for receiving.

7
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:18.318
Identify the SKU to receive, then continue to the quantity
entry screen.

8
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.255
Enter the received quantity. The destination shown in this
example is the staging location.

9
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.906
The screen returns to SKU entry, showing progress against
the receipt.

10
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.678
Review the receipt summary.
